WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.844
Shared database objects should not be mysterious
PostgreSQL's

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:11.555
information schema can show view names and
definitions Run this query

00:00:11.581 --> 00:00:17.466
and inspect the SQL behind the analytics views Being
able to inspect

00:00:17.479 --> 00:00:21.110
a view helps with debugging documentation and change
review
